# ESP32 Smart Refrigerator

## Overview
An IoT-based Smart Refrigerator using ESP32 to monitor temperature and humidity and control cooling automatically.

## Features
- Real-time temperature monitoring
- Humidity monitoring
- Automatic cooling control
- Manual and automatic operating modes
- Blynk IoT mobile application
- Remote refrigerator monitoring

## Hardware Components
- ESP32 DevKit V1
- DHT11 Temperature and Humidity Sensor
- Relay Module
- MQ135 Gas Sensor
- Connecting wires
- Cooling fan

## Software & Technologies
- Arduino IDE
- ESP32
- Embedded C++
- Blynk IoT
- Wi-Fi

## Working
The ESP32 reads temperature and humidity from the DHT11 sensor. Based on the programmed conditions, it controls the cooling system through a relay. Users can monitor the system remotely through the Blynk application.

